{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15481","headline":"送王副使还幷州 · 李端","name":"送王副使还幷州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幷州近胡地，此去事风沙。\n铁马垂金络，貂裘犯雪花。\n曾持两郡印，多比五侯家。\n继世新恩厚，从军旧国赊。\n戍烟千里直，边雁一行斜。\n想到清油幕，长谋出左军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}